DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
45797::$$$message_0441_0000_0000$$$::"Hm, hmm, hmm[humming]"::
45798::$$$message_0441_0000_0001$$$::"I think we'll be able to move the atelier, and now we're another step closer to the orchestra of our dreams."::
45799::$$$message_0441_0000_0002$$$::"On top of that, this hot spring bloodbath is as cool as it gets! Ahh, my whole life feels worth it now!"::
45800::$$$message_0441_0000_0003$$$::"...Hm? Did I just call a [font italic=true]hot[font italic=false] spring [font italic=true]cool[font italic=false]? That's weird."::
45801::$$$message_0441_0000_0004$$$::"Whatever. Oh, yeah. How's your first onsen experience, big man?"::
45802::$$$message_0441_0000_0005$$$::"Ohh... To think that Jeanne could be recreated so small and with such precision!"::
45803::$$$message_0441_0000_0006$$$::"This face! This skin! This nape! This is, without a doubt, the Jeanne I met that day, in that time and place!"::
45804::$$$message_0441_0000_0007$$$::"I see now that the depravity of capitalism is not to be underestimated! ...Hm."::
45805::$$$message_0441_0000_0008$$$::"Hey, big man!"::
45806::$$$message_0441_0000_0009$$$::"Ah, apologies, Ryunosuke. What is it?"::
45807::$$$message_0441_0000_0010$$$::"I was asking if you like the bath."::
45808::$$$message_0441_0000_0011$$$::"Ah, the onsen? Hmm... The custom of soaking in a bath never took root in my culture..."::
45809::$$$message_0441_0000_0012$$$::"But I find it quite charming."::
45810::$$$message_0441_0000_0013$$$::"I know, right? You soak in a warm bath to refresh your body and mind. Makes you feel like you can give a hundred percent tomorrow."::
45812::$$$message_0441_0000_0015$$$::"OOHHHHH!"::
45813::$$$message_0441_0000_0016$$$::"B-big man!?"::
45814::$$$message_0441_0000_0017$$$::"Jeanne! One of my Jeanne's lovely, slender fingers just snapped off!"::
45815::$$$message_0441_0000_0018$$$::"Ahh... It's because you keep playing with it. Figurines are easier to break than people. ...Oh."::
45816::$$$message_0441_0000_0019$$$::"N-now one of her hairs, far more than worth its weight in gold, just...AHHHHH!"::
45817::$$$message_0441_0000_0020$$$::"Damn it all! How much more will God toy with me until He is satisfied!?"::
45818::$$$message_0441_0000_0021$$$::"God never answers when we pray to Him, yet He obstructs our path unbidden... How rotten and vile He is!"::
45819::$$$message_0441_0000_0022$$$::"Even a child knows better, to do unto others as you would have them do unto you!"::
45820::$$$message_0441_0000_0023$$$::"Yeah, well, you should probably do something about your nails if you're going to keep messing with the figurine."::
45821::$$$message_0441_0000_0024$$$::"Now the paint is coming off!!!"::

